      "content": "thanks. i'm trying to get deeper into the \"religious liberal\" side though. can u expand on the philosophical foundations they use? like, what are the specific theological frameworks they use to justify autonomy and compassion in this context? i want to make sure i'm not just framing it as \"they want to be nice,\" but actually understanding the scholarly depth there.",
